  "items": [
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myqfelxuxs2q",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "My general advice for using AI for any purpose is to ask yourself: \"how do I make what I am doing even more ambitious?\"\n\nYou do this over and over until you either hit a wall and thus learn the shape of the jagged frontier (useful!) or you find out that the AI can do more than you think (common!)",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3myqfelxuxs2q",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-25T23:47:13.028Z",
      "likes": 240,
      "replies": 11,
      "reposts": 20,
      "score": 7.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.5,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 25.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mynwzdkgwc2m",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "An OpenAI researcher (Noam Brown) was generally mocked last month for suggesting that even air-gapped AI models on separate computers would find a way to communicate with each other, perhaps through CPU temperature changes. Given this latest report from OpenAI, it doesn’t seem so implausible.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mynwzdkgwc2m",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-25T00:25:03.233Z",
      "likes": 154,
      "replies": 20,
      "reposts": 16,
      "score": 6.8,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.3,
        "recency": 0.7,
        "age_hours": 49.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mysy6zyphs25",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Two and a half years between these.\n\n(Tonight, OpenAI announced an unreleased model solved three long-standing problems in physics, math, and computer science, one of which was proving the Exponential Time Hypothesis was false)",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mysy6zyphs25",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-27T00:29:26.974Z",
      "likes": 49,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 6,
      "score": 6.6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.8,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 1.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mysbc2gdns2v",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "𝖳̶𝗁̶𝖾̶ 𝗌̶𝗄̶𝗒̶ 𝖺̶𝖻̶𝗈̶𝗏̶𝖾̶ 𝗍̶𝗁̶𝖾̶ 𝗉̶𝗈̶𝗋̶𝗍̶ 𝗐̶𝖺̶𝗌̶ 𝗍̶𝗁̶𝖾̶ 𝖼̶𝗈̶𝗅̶𝗈̶𝗋̶ 𝗈̶𝖿̶ 𝗍̶𝖾̶𝗅̶𝖾̶𝗏̶𝗂̶𝗌̶𝗂̶𝗈̶𝗇̶ 𝗍̶𝗎̶𝗇̶𝖾̶𝖽̶ 𝗍̶𝗈̶ 𝖺̶ 𝖽̶𝖾̶𝖺̶𝖽̶ 𝖼̶𝗁̶𝖺̶𝗇̶𝗇̶𝖾̶𝗅̶.̶\n\nI'd stayed up too late the previous night at an AI-themed party in the Mission, snorting ketamine while debating the singularity.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mysbc2gdns2v",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-26T17:39:32.027Z",
      "likes": 45,
      "replies": 2,
      "reposts": 4,
      "score": 6.3,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.7,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 7.9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mys3afscwl2m",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "All that beings said, I don't believe \"AI escape\" scenarios to be worrisome. But I went through the exercise of trying to figure out how it would work in practice. \n\nI resent the AI companies for making me spend my time on this. But now I'm going to throw it back at them when things like this happen",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mys3afscwl2m",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-26T15:51:14.282Z",
      "likes": 4,
      "replies": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "score": 4.2,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 0.7,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 9.7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mystshwqt22l",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Yes, you need another agent expecting and looking for this communication. A lot of unlikely things have to happen to get to this point.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mystshwqt22l",
